Subject: retain authored diagnostic coordinate provenance across reparse
Upstream-Status: Local embedding (not submitted)

The parser reuses a user macro call-site line number while interpreting an
expanded buffer, whose columns do not address the authored input. Record the
coordinate origin through parse, syntax nodes, and validation so the embedding
observer can retain the source identity without inventing authored positions.

